<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT - Fraser upgrades FELS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fraser upgrades FELS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Securities Pte Ltd said on Friday it has upgraded its recommendation for rig builder Far East Levingston Shipbuilding (FELS) to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;underweight&quot;.  </p>
<p>Fraser said in a research note it remained concerned by increasing competition despite the group's confidence it would win more contracts based on its track record and expertise.</p>
<p>&quot;As such, we are upgrading our recommendation to a hold from underweight previously,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
